  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nIn [StructuredSerializeInternal](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/structured-data.html#structuredserializeinternal), step 17.1 the value of the 'name' property of the Error object is retrieved, and then in step 17.2 it is compared to several strings.\r\nSince `Get(O, P)` returns a value, comparing it to those strings can be interpreted in multiple ways.\r\nI think a ToString call between those 2 steps is missing (which might throw as well)",
